text I'm so nervous I even forget to swallow.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I can't match his speed...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (Isn't there some way for me to make an opening...?)
text I hold my bag up as a shield.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGAK22H"
